  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.2.3\n\n- Align the package version with the readable contract JSON release; embedded middleware behavior is unchanged.\n\n## 0.2.2\n\n- Validate route patterns with the runtime matcher when compiling a rule set and name rejected patterns in warnings.\n- Preserve the embedded host's configurable response header policy; hosted authoring uses the public host allowlist.\n\n## 0.2.1\n\n- Correct public documentation and product links.\n- Align the package version with the Echo package release and include NuGet release notes and symbols.\n\n## 0.2.0\n\n- Read the hierarchical rule feed shared with the mock client package.\n- Keep implemented endpoints in control and pass unmatched requests to the next middleware.",
